### Step 2: the orchestrator fix on the object of the app pictures (2026-11-09)

Rule: an app picture shows the object that the unit 2 story or check-row spec of the same word
draws, in kind and color. The source spec is the story spec of the week of the word, or the
check-row spec of the word when that spec draws the word alone.

